      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1058,
      "width": 959.2,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "Every mode: leaving before the deal frees the seat (the last person out deletes the table). Stats count every\nmode, filed as humans only or with bots (a bot held a seat at some point). Live Play and Play vs bots are\nhidden while BOTS_ENABLED is false, since they need bots to fill their seats.",
      "originalText": "Every mode: leaving before the deal frees the seat (the last person out deletes the table). Stats count every\nmode, filed as humans only or with bots (a bot held a seat at some point). Live Play and Play vs bots are\nhidden while BOTS_ENABLED is false, since they need bots to fill their seats.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
