      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2628,
      "width": 492.80000000000007,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "No claims once a team has 5 marks, or at a paused table.\nWon with claims still waiting: those players are let go\nand their app searches again.\nLeaving under way: a bot takes the seat at once; if\nnobody else is present the match is dropped.",
      "originalText": "No claims once a team has 5 marks, or at a paused table.\nWon with claims still waiting: those players are let go\nand their app searches again.\nLeaving under way: a bot takes the seat at once; if\nnobody else is present the match is dropped.",
